# Snapshot: cli/usage

## Case: `-h`

### Result

Command:

```text
build/frogc -h
```

Output:

```text
Usage:
  frogc < source.frog > source.c
  frogc <command> [options]

Commands:
  run [-c CODE | FILE]       compile and run Frog source
  build [-o FILE] [-r] FILE  compile Frog source to a binary
```

